# Polynomial multiplication of 4 coefficients by 7, over GF(2).
# Slice i is the matrix of the bilinear form producing output coefficient c_i,
# so slice i has a 1 at (j,k) exactly when j+k == i. Naive rank is 4*7 = 28.
field 2
shape 10 4 7

